          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogundi mutwe gw'abarikugyenda nibahimbisa gwatoora aha rubaju rwa bumosho, naanye naagyenda mbakuratiire aha mutwe gw'orugo, nyine ekicweka ky'abantu, twatoora aha rubaju rw'omunaara gw'ebikoomi, twahika aha rugo ruhanga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bwanyima twaraba aha Irembo rya Efuraimu, n'aha Irembo rya ira, n'aha Irembo ry'eby'enyanja, n'aha munaara gwa Hananeeli, n'aha gwa Hameeya, twahika aha Irembo ry'entaama, twayemerera aha Irembo ry'abakumiirizi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etyo egyo mitwe yombi y'abantu abarikusiima yaayemerera omu nju ya Ruhanga, hamwe naanye n'ekicweka ky'abatware abu naabaire nyine, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'abanyamurwa Eliakimu, Maaseya, Minyamiini, Mikaaya, Elio-enai, Zekaria na Hanania baine amakondere; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi na Maaseya, Shemaaya, Eleazaari, Uuzi, Yehohanani, Malikiya, Elamu na Ezeri. Kandi abeeshongozi baayeshongora n'amaraka mahango, nibeebemberwa Yezerahia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eryo izooba baatabma ebitambo bingi nibashemererwa; ahabw'okuba Ruhanga akaba abahaire okushemererwa kwingi; kandi abakazi n'abaana bato nabo baashemererwa. Kyareetera akaari k'okushemererwa kw'omuri Yerusaalemu kuhuririrwa hare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
