        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima eryo izooba baatoorana abantu b'okureeberera ebishengye by'amabiikiro, agarikubiikwamu emitoijo, n'emiganuro, n'ebicweka bya kimwe kya ikumi, n'okuteeraniramu emigabo y'abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi nk'ebiragiro oku birikuragiira, nk'oku emisiri y'endembo zaabo yaabaire eri; ahabw'okuba Abayuda bakashemererwa ahabw'okureeba abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi bari ha mirimo yaabo; ",
